{"3512720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams", "steam_appid": 3512720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Unmasked Truths is made by humans, not AI. \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams</strong> is a murder mystery releasing episodically in 3 massive, fully voiced (<strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong>) arcs. The first arc releases in late 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive, character-focused storytelling and game mechanics aim to provide a fresh, modern take on nostalgic late ‘90s, ‘00s, and 2010’s-era murder mystery (and especially “killing game”) fan favorite series and games where players take on a detective-like role similar to those found in Danganronpa, Ai: The Somnium Files, Persona 5, and Ace Attorney. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs inspired by the likes of Genshin Impact and Nier: Automata blend seamlessly with a 3D world in which Baroque-inspired architecture is brought into the future with a subtle sci-fi twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmasked Truths is perfect for fans of visual novels and detective games brimming with rich, dramatic narratives that grip players and stick with them long after the game’s mysteries are solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are <i>you</i> ready for a story you’ll never forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams is proudly created by humans, not AI.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/9ac4162d0bd141ab6483bbf38f9a2860.avif?t=1778703275\" width=500 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the year 20XX and 10 world-renowned experts have agreed to take a rocket ride into space where they will take part in a first-of-its-kind intensive summer program run by the world’s top governing authority. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal? Prove that they are the best of the best and worthy of the exclusive title: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World☆Class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a relaxing stay managed by AI twins at a lavish baroque space resort-turned-college-campus takes a deadly turn when it’s revealed that only 5 individuals will be graduating with their title…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and their lives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players rotate between characters throughout the story, including a no-nonsense prosecutor, happy-go-lucky daredevil, strong-of-heart street fighter, K-Pop idol, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the 3D environment to collect evidence, participate in themed trials and minigames, and cast your vote to discover the truth of who's living a lie in this fully voiced murder mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/406f5ff9ba84a53ad31dfe60eedb05b3.webp?t=1778703275\" width=500 height=35 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.poster.avif?t=1778703275\" aria-label=\"Characters are fully voiced in English\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.webm?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.mp4?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Character dialogue is fully voiced in </strong>English <strong>and</strong> Japanese<strong>, featuring the talents of:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophia Alexandra, World☆Class Teacher - <strong>Cherami Leigh</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maria Dandois, World☆Class Street Fighter - <strong>Heather Gonzalez</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kristine Brown, World☆Class Voyager - <strong>Suzie McGrath</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashe Buckley, World☆Class Hunter - <strong>Casey Mongillo</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lee Dae Hyun, World☆Class Idol — <strong>Jason Vu</strong>, (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucienne Gant, World☆Class Barista - <strong>Ryan Bartley</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergei Ivankov, World☆Class Manager - <strong>Kyle McCarley</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack Pakenham, World☆Class Daredevil - <strong>Leigh Joel Scott</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Izumi Sada, World☆Class Psychologist - <strong>Jenny Yokobori</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leandre Thaïs, &quot;Some Guy&quot; - <strong>Nazeeh Tarsha</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renard Thaïs, World☆Class Prosecutor - <strong>Alejandro Saab</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice - <strong>Xanthe Hyunh</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas - <strong>Nathan Vitale</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa &quot;Joe&quot; Razzi - <strong>Joe Zieja</strong> (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.poster.avif?t=1778703275\" aria-label=\"Choices change relationships and the game&#039;s ending\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.webm?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.mp4?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Decisions Matter</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices impact character relationships, unlock routes, unveil bonus scenes, and ultimately determine who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Play as different characters to learn the full story.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=1101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Everyone is a Suspect</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has been killed, and everyone is a potential suspect. Investigate the  scene for clues and gather evidence before engaging in a high-stakes debate to unveil the truth and unmask the murderer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Mirror your partner&#039;s moves in rhythm minigames!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Fish for answers in this classic fishing minigame with a twist!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Minigames</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by clearing minigames inspired by the characters' unique skills! Fish for answers, engage in heated battles to see whose evidence is stronger, mirror your partner's moves to support their arguments, remove mental blocks to uncover clues, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.poster.avif?t=1778703275\" aria-label=\"Explore a vast 3D environment\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.webm?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.mp4?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Free Roaming / Free Time Exploration</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the vast college campus to discover more about the world, collect hidden items, witness spectacular views, and learn more about characters. The information may come in handy when unraveling the secrets of this social deduction game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Unmasked Truths is made by humans, not AI. \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams</strong> is a murder mystery releasing episodically in 3 massive, fully voiced (<strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong>) arcs. The first arc releases in late 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive, character-focused storytelling and game mechanics aim to provide a fresh, modern take on nostalgic late ‘90s, ‘00s, and 2010’s-era murder mystery (and especially “killing game”) fan favorite serie