ragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.avif?t=1778703275\" alt=\"Fish for answers in this classic fishing minigame with a twist!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.webp?t=1778703275 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Minigames</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by clearing minigames inspired by the characters' unique skills! Fish for answers, engage in heated battles to see whose evidence is stronger, mirror your partner's moves to support their arguments, remove mental blocks to uncover clues, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.poster.avif?t=1778703275\" aria-label=\"Explore a vast 3D environment\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.webm?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.mp4?t=1778703275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Free Roaming / Free Time Exploration</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the vast college campus to discover more about the world, collect hidden items, witness spectacular views, and learn more about characters. The information may come in handy when unraveling the secrets of this social deduction game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "10 world-renowned experts are trapped together and must cooperate to survive... until conflicts arise, and they discover the greatest threat to their lives isn't the system they're resisting: it's each other! Discover the truth of who's living a lie in this fully voiced murder mystery adventure.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/af37f4a94364f4a539fe46d3cd5ad573445ee087/header.jpg?t=1778703275", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/7084b5a43f90d0e4c61a2151be9971e4304c9ee4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778703275", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/7084b5a43f90d0e4c61a2151be9971e4304c9ee4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778703275", "website": "https://unmaskedtruthsgame.com/?utm_source=Steam&amp;utm_medium=profile", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-8350K or AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050Ti or AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)/Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super, 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX 5600XT, 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB availab